{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","托安"],["/names/en","Thoran"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名可以复活的坦克，擅长利用对手的伤害进行反击。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Tank who can revive himself and reflect damage back to attackers."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","所有人……都会付出代价。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Everyone must pay a price."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","强大或许能让我仁慈……一点点。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Power may make me more merciful. Little at least."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","你会得到回报！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","You'll get what's coming to you!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我总会归来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I will always return..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","向王者致敬！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Kneel before the king!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","回归王座的道路，唯有怒火方能点亮……"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","The path back to the throne is illuminated only by rage..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","啊，啊，啊，啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","It's not time... for my eternal slumber."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","你大概不会背叛我吧？你也不会吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","You're the only one who's never betrayed me. We will make them pay."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","所有人都会付出代价，因为我已经富过了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","The day will come when we'll reclaim what was lost!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","待我回归王座，你将会得到回报！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","You shall be rewarded when I reclaim my throne!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","很好。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Very good."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","还没到休息的时候！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's not time to rest yet!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不能掉以轻心……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Can't let my guard down..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊，一小杯酒，足够了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Ah, a fresh glass of water can work wonders."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯变亮了……真刺眼"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The lights are too bright, they hurt my eyes..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","棒极了，寒冷的深夜……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wonderful. A cold, deep night..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……真够热闹的"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","...How noisy."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯光太刺眼了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The lights are too bright."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","托安生前是一个相当信任他人的君主，这也导致了他的帝国覆灭。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Thoran was a trusting ruler in life, a quality that ultimately led to the demise of his kingdom."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","托安常挂在嘴上的两个词——“背叛”与“复仇”。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Only two thoughts occupy Thoran's mind: \"betrayal\" and \"vengeance\"."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安刚复活时，曾发现自己的王冠少了一颗宝石。这颗宝石后来被盛在盒中，由一双断手捧着送还给托安，断手来自于那个窃贼。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","It is rumored that upon his resurrection, Thoran noticed a jewel missing from his crown. When the jewel was discovered hidden in a box, it was presented to Thoran with a pair of severed hands. They were the hands of the thief."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","托安以重铸班题斯帝国的荣光为己任，这无人不晓的覆灭帝国版图曾超过如今的耀光。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Thoran took it upon himself to restore the Bantus Kingdom to its rightful glory and remind the world of its past splendor."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","班题斯帝国的象征——亡灵圣器被窃，至今下落不明，托安至今仍在寻找其踪迹。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Thoran is in search of the Graveborn Relic, the stolen icon of the Bantus Kingdom."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安复活时，将许多生前的部下也一齐复活，又陆续放逐了那些因君主性情大变不再愿意追随的人。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","They say that a number of Thoran's most devoted followers were also brought back to life when he was resurrected. Those who disagreed with their revived ruler's twisted temperament were summarily banished from his court."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据一些考古学家说，锈锚港周边不知为何保存着一些昔日班题斯帝国舰队的风貌。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Scholars have noted, with no small amount of perplexity, that several areas around Rustport retained traces of the Bantus Kingdom's naval history."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说，托安和那个追逐着生命力的亡灵组织有千丝万缕的联系，但亡灵猎人们尚且无法靠近托安，寻求真相。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Thoran is rumored to have formed an inextricable bond with a certain Graveborn group, one with an insatiable hunger for life force. Unfortunately, no undead hunters have been able to approach Thoran to ascertain the truth."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","托安十分反感明明已经成为亡灵，还保留着生前温情与回忆的人。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Thoran absolutely detests all Graveborn who retain the warmth and memories of their previous lives. \"I loathe those who desperately cling to the past,\" he once declared during an execution."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","不知为何，据托安的一些部下透露，托安对神明并不十分敬畏。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","According to some of Thoran's subordinates, he is not particularly reverent of the gods. \"They are no more evil or righteous than you or I,\" Thoran mused once when he was deep in his cups."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","还没到休息的时候！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","It's not time to rest yet!"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415124.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415124.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊，一小杯酒，足够了"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Ah, a fresh glass of water can work wonders."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415125.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415125.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","……又到了这个季节。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","It's that time of year again."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415345.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415345.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","托安 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Thoran & Viperian"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","灯变亮了……真刺眼"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","The lights are too bright, they hurt my eyes..."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415435.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415435.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","棒极了，寒冷的深夜……"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Wonderful. A cold, deep night..."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415436.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415436.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","……真够热闹的"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","...How noisy."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415611.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415611.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","灯光太刺眼了"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","The lights are too bright."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415612.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415612.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","托安"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Thoran"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","向您致敬，尊敬的陛下，能见到您真是我的无上荣幸。"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Your Majesty, it's my highest honor to be in your presence."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415699.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415699.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","沙利叶 & 托安"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Ravion & Thoran"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","哼……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Hmph..."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415809.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415809.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","托安 & 格瑞泽尔勒（未完整）"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Thoran & Grezhul (incomplete)"]]}